{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"hellowind777.hellogrok","latestVersion":"0.1.41","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Cross-platform local proxy that makes Grok Build custom model channels work with common API formats, native Web tools, isolated authentication, and automatic configuration recovery.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Cross-platform local proxy that makes Grok Build custom model channels work with common API formats, native Web tools, isolated authentication, and automatic configuration recovery.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Grok Build can use custom model endpoints, but real-world providers do not all expose the same protocol, response shape, authentication method, or Web-search behavior. hellogrok provides one local compatibility layer for those custom channels: it prepares the required Grok configuration while running, keeps each channel tied to its own endpoint and credentials, supports Grok Build native Web workflows, and restores the original configuration when stopped.","name":"hellogrok","packageUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok","publisher":"hellowind777","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#0141-2026-09-20","tags":["grok","grok-build","proxy"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"跨平台 Grok Build 本地代理，让自定义模型渠道兼容常见 API 格式、Build 原生 Web 工具、独立鉴权和自动配置恢复。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Grok Build 可以接入自定义模型端点，但不同服务商实际提供的协议、响应格式、鉴权方式和 Web 搜索能力并不一致。hellogrok 为这些自定义渠道提供统一的本地兼容层：运行时准备 Grok 必需配置，让每个渠道固定使用自己的端点和凭据，支持 Grok Build 原生 Web 工作流，并在停止时恢复原始配置。","tags":["grok","grok-build","代理"]}},"longDescription":"Grok Build can use custom model endpoints, but real-world providers do not all expose the same protocol, response shape, authentication method, or Web-search behavior. hellogrok provides one local compatibility layer for those custom channels: it prepares the required Grok configuration while running, keeps each channel tied to its own endpoint and credentials, supports Grok Build native Web workflows, and restores the original configuration when stopped.","name":"hellogrok","packageUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok","publisher":"hellowind777","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/hellowind777/hellogrok/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#0141-2026-09-20","tags":["grok","grok-build","proxy"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.41/app.json","detailSha256":"669df110b2348439adff17ef845e0e92eb15a0efd48119d1888aefa739eb4421","releaseDate":"2026-09-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.41"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.40/app.json","detailSha256":"9a385d01a8e9b11d275408c749454be97054712f33abbcb2abf2e0645af228c4","releaseDate":"2026-09-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.40"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.39/app.json","detailSha256":"47c3b64488a87da0edbfb332fb2b06158d24c13f615d2089e13acd2e095722bc","releaseDate":"2026-09-17","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.39"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.38/app.json","detailSha256":"c647dea633fec1d3a228a7288e9b45ae8e1abbd449e96fa9c0802690ff633a39","releaseDate":"2026-09-16","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.38"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.37/app.json","detailSha256":"fa87bcfc3631867869b0216c62a08d241fbd1c6c476635199f0d244de2ea5449","releaseDate":"2026-09-16","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.37"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.35/app.json","detailSha256":"abd75cbadc58e79bc786be28c97193e7852c2f782172d0cf450b